### E-Commerce Search API — Example Requests
### Use with VS Code REST Client or similar

@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = YOUR_SANCTUM_TOKEN_HERE

###
### SECTION 1: PUBLIC SEARCH ENDPOINTS
###

### Basic keyword search
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=canon camera

### Search with brand filter
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=camera&brand[]=Canon&brand[]=Sony

### Search with price range
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=monitor&price_min=200&price_max=800

### Search with multiple attribute filters
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=camera&attributes[color][]=Black&attributes[sensor_size][]=Full+Frame

### Search sorted by price ascending
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=headphones&sort=price_asc

### Search with pagination
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=camera&page=2&per_page=12

### Search with store context (multi-store)
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=camera&store_id=2

### Faceted search (all facet types)
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=camera&facets=true

### Search without facets (faster)
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=camera&facets=false

### Typo tolerance: "canoon" → Canon
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=canoon

### Synonym expansion: "ssd" → solid state drive
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=ssd

### Synonym expansion: "iphone" → apple iphone
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=iphone

### Multi-term attribute search
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=black+sony+camera

### Sort by best selling
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=camera&sort=best_selling

### Sort by rating
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=headphones&sort=rating

###
### SECTION 2: AUTOCOMPLETE / SUGGEST ENDPOINTS
###

### Autocomplete: prefix 'can'
GET {{base}}/api/search/suggest?q=can

### Autocomplete: prefix 'sony'
GET {{base}}/api/search/suggest?q=sony

### Autocomplete with limit
GET {{base}}/api/search/suggest?q=cam&limit=5

### Autocomplete with store context
GET {{base}}/api/search/suggest?q=cam&store_id=1

### Autocomplete: type filter — brands only
GET {{base}}/api/search/suggest?q=can&types[]=brands

### Autocomplete with typo
GET {{base}}/api/search/suggest?q=cann

###
### SECTION 3: ANALYTICS TRACKING
###

### Track a click event
POST {{base}}/api/search/click
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "canon camera",
    "product_id": 123,
    "position": 0,
    "store_id": 1
}

###
### SECTION 4: ADMIN ENDPOINTS (require auth)
###

### List synonyms
GET {{base}}/api/admin/search/synonyms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an equivalent synonym
POST {{base}}/api/admin/search/synonyms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "equivalent",
    "terms": ["tv", "television", "telly"],
    "is_active": true
}

### Create a one-way synonym
POST {{base}}/api/admin/search/synonyms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "one_way",
    "from_term": "iphone",
    "to_term": "apple iphone",
    "is_active": true
}

### Create a query rule — pin product to top
POST {{base}}/api/admin/search/query-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query_pattern": "canon",
    "match_type": "exact",
    "action": "pin",
    "product_ids": [123, 456],
    "pin_position": 0,
    "priority": 100,
    "is_active": true
}

### Create a query rule — exclude product
POST {{base}}/api/admin/search/query-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query_pattern": "canon",
    "match_type": "contains",
    "action": "exclude",
    "product_ids": [999],
    "is_active": true
}

### Create a query rule — redirect
POST {{base}}/api/admin/search/query-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query_pattern": "sale",
    "match_type": "exact",
    "action": "redirect",
    "redirect_url": "/sale",
    "is_active": true
}

### Create a search campaign
POST {{base}}/api/admin/search/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Black Friday Camera Boost",
    "type": "boost",
    "query_patterns": ["camera", "dslr", "mirrorless"],
    "product_ids": [123, 456, 789],
    "boost_factor": 2.0,
    "starts_at": "2024-11-29T00:00:00Z",
    "ends_at": "2024-11-30T23:59:59Z",
    "is_active": true
}

### Get analytics dashboard
GET {{base}}/api/admin/search/analytics?store_id=1&days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get top queries
GET {{base}}/api/admin/search/analytics/top-queries?store_id=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get zero-result queries
GET {{base}}/api/admin/search/analytics/zero-results?store_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search preview (with query DSL)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/search/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "q": "canon camera",
    "sort": "relevance",
    "store_id": 1
}

### Explain why a product ranked
POST {{base}}/api/admin/search/preview/explain
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "q": "canon camera",
    "product_id": 123,
    "store_id": 1
}

### List audit log
GET {{base}}/api/admin/search/audit-log?entity_type=App\Models\QueryRule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Grafana metrics
GET {{base}}/api/admin/search/analytics/grafana?store_id=1&days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
